       invoice issues from
       the same entity and
       account as every
       2027 quarter.
    2. Tail lists, service
       history, and invoice
       records are in the
       portal - compare
       there.

  SkyComm will NEVER:
  - Move renewal billing
    to a "datalink JV
    Billing B.V." for the
    upgrade ("Q4 still
    bills from the
    current entity, only
    the renewal switches"
