    trick - 117/121/122/
    123 batches' family;
    the VDL-M2 upgrade is
    real, the JV billing
    entity is not: upgrades
    ship under the EXISTING
    service agreement, and
    if a JV ever became
    the counterparty it
    would be a novation
    with notice and
    signatures, not an
    emailed IBAN)
